:"comp","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Component type required by members of this family."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"excludedComponents","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"All component types that must not be assigned to an entity in this family."}]}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"text":"Return Value","anchor":"return-value","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The family of entities having 1 required components each.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A family is a collection of entities with uniform component types per entity.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Entities that are be part of this family will have at least the 1 required components,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"but may have more components assigned.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A family is just a view on (component) data, creating them is cheap.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"Use them to iterate efficiently over entities with the same components assigned."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Families with the same requirements provide a view on the same collection of entities (aka members)."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"A family conforms to the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"LazySequenceProtocol"},{"type":"text","text":" and therefore can be accessed like any other (lazy) sequence."}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"General usage"}]}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","code":["let family = nexus.family(requires: Comp1.self)","\/\/ iterate each entity's components","family.forEach { (comp1) in","  ...","}"],"syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineConte